t\t</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t</ul>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tab__content wds-is-current\">\n\t\t\t\t\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"description\">\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">When Arlecchino successfully absorbs a Blood-Debt Directive, Balemoon Rising's CD will decrease by 2s and 15 Elemental Energy will be restored to her. This effect can occur once every 10s.</div>\n</div>\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tab__content\">\n\t\t\t\t\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"utility1\">\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><b>Utility</b><ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Cooldown_Reduction\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Cooldown Reduction\">Cooldown Reduction</a></li><li><a href=\"/wiki/Energy\" title=\"Energy\">Energy</a></li></ul></div>\n</div>\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t</section>\n\n\n\n\n</section>\n</aside>\n\n<b>\"You Shall Love and Protect Each Other Henceforth...\"</b> is <a href=\"/wiki/Arlecchino\" title=\"Arlecchino\">Arlecchino</a>'s <a href=\"/wiki/Level_4_Constellation\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Level 4 Constellation\">Level 4 Constellation</a>.\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Other_Languages\">Other Languages</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fgenshin-impact.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2F%2522You_Shall_Love_and_Protect_Each_Other_Henceforth...%2522%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D1&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-auth-modal=\"signin\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"article-table\">\n<tbody><tr><th>Language</th><th>Official Name</th><th>Literal Meaning</th></tr><tr><td><b>English</b></td><td>\"You Shall Love and Protect Each Other Henceforth...\"</td><td>&#8212;</td></tr><tr><td><b>Chinese<br /><small>(Simplified)</small></b></td><td><span lang=\"zh-Hans\">「此后，你们须相爱相护…」</span><br /><small><i><span lang=\"zh-rm\">\"Cǐhòu, Nǐmen Xū Xiāng'ài Xiānghù...\"</span></i></small></td><td rowspan=\"2\">\"Henceforth, You Shall Love and Protect Each Other...\"</td></tr><tr><td><b>Chinese<br /><small>(Traditional)</small></b></td><td><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">「此後，</span><span>(&#8205;<span class=\"custom-tt-wrapper toggle-tooltip mw-collapsible mw-made-collapsible mw-collapsed giw-collapsible\" data-tt-text=\"你\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible-toggle mw-collapsible-toggle-collapsed custom-tt toggle-tooltip\"><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">你</span></span><span class=\"mw-collapsible-content custom-tt\" style=\"display:none\">Text for male Traveler</span></span>&#8205;/<wbr />&#8205;<span class=\"custom-tt-wrapper toggle-tooltip mw-collapsible mw-made-collapsible mw-collapsed giw-collapsible\" data-tt-text=\"妳\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible-toggle mw-collapsible-toggle-collapsed custom-tt toggle-tooltip\"><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">妳</span></span><span class=\"mw-collapsible-content custom-tt\" style=\"display:none\">Text for female Traveler</span></span>&#8205;)</span><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">們須相愛相護…」</span><br /><small><i><span lang=\"zh-rm\">\"Cǐhòu, Nǐmen Xū Xiāng'ài Xiānghù...\"</span></i></small></td></tr><tr><td><b>Japanese</b></td><td><span lang=\"ja\">「これからは互いを慈しみ</span> <span lang=\"ja\">手を取り合うとしよう…」</span><br /><small><i>\"Kore kara wa Otagai wo Itsukushimi Te wo Toriau to Shiyou...\"</i></small></td><td>\"From Now On You Shall Love Each Other and Join Hands...\"</td></tr><tr><td><b>Korean</b></td><td><span lang=\"ko\">「앞으로</span> <span lang=\"ko\">사이좋게</span> <span lang=\"ko\">지내거라…」</span><br /><small><i>\"Apeuro Saijoke Jinaegeora...\"</i></small></td><td>\"Be On Good Terms With Each Other From Now...\"</td></tr><tr><td><b>Spanish</b></td><td>Entonces, se amar<span lang=\"es\">á</span>n y se proteger<span lang=\"es\">á</span>n</td><td>Henceforth, You Will Love and Protect Each Other</td></tr><tr><td><b>French</b></td><td><span lang=\"fr\">«</span>&#160;D<span lang=\"fr\">é</span>sormais, vous devez vous aimer et vous prot<span lang=\"fr\">é</span>ger...&#160;<span lang=\"fr\">»</span></td><td>\"Now, You Must Love and Protect Each Other...\"</td></tr><tr><td><b>Russian</b></td><td><span lang=\"ru\">«Впредь</span> <span lang=\"ru\">любите</span> <span lang=\"ru\">и</span> <span lang=\"ru\">защищайте</span> <span lang=\"ru\">друг</span> <span lang=\"ru\">друга</span>...<span lang=\"ru\">»</span><br /><small><i>\"Vpred' lyubite i zashchishchayte drug druga...\"</i></small></td><td>\"Henceforth You Shall Love and Protect Each Other...\"</td></tr><tr><td><b>Thai</b></td><td>\"You Shall Love and Protect Each Other Henceforth...<wbr />\"</td><td>&#8212;</td></tr><tr><td><b>Vietnamese</b></td><td><span lang=\"vi\">\"Sau Này, Các Ngươi Yêu Thương Tương Trợ Nhau...\"</span></td><td></td></tr><tr><td><b>German</b></td><td><span lang=\"de\">„</span>Von nun an m<span lang=\"de\">ü</span>sst ihr euch gegenseitig lieben und besch<span lang=\"de\">ü</span>tzen ...<wbr /><span lang=\"de\">“</span></td><td>\"From Now On You Must Love and Protect Each Other...\"</td></tr><tr><td><b>Indonesian</b></td><td>\"You Shall Love and Protect Each Other Henceforth ...\"</td><td>&#8212;</td></tr><tr><td><b>Portuguese</b></td><td>\"De Hoje em Diante, Amor e Prote<span lang=\"pt\">çã</span>o M<span lang=\"pt\">ú</span>tua...\"</td><td></td></tr><tr><td><b>Turkish</b></td><td>\"Bundan B<span lang=\"tr\">ö</span>yle Birbirinizi Sevip Koruyun...\"</td><td></td></tr><tr><td><b>Italian</b></td><td>\"D'ora in avanti, amatevi e proteggetevi l'un l'altro...\"</td><td>\"From Now on, Love and Protect One Another...\"</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Change_History\">Change History</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fgenshin-impact.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2F%2522You_Shall_Love_and_Protect_Each_Other_Henceforth...%2522%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D2&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-auth-modal=\"signin\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<div class=\"change-history\"><div class=\"change-history-header\"><div>Released in <b><a href=\"/wiki/Version/4.6\" title=\"Version/4.6\">Version 4.6</a></b></div><div>[<a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" class=\"text\" href=\"https://genshin-impact.fandom.com/wiki/%22You_Shall_Love_and_Protect_Each_Other_Henceforth...%22/Change_History?action=edit&amp;preload=Template:Change_History/Preload&amp;preloadparams%5b%5d=4.6&amp;preloadparams%5b%5d=%22You+Shall+Love+and+Protect+Each+Other+Henceforth...%22\">Create New History</a>]</div></div></div><div style=\"clear:both; margin:0; padding:0;\"></div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Navigation\">Navigation</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fgenshin-impact.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2F%2522You_Shall_Love_and_Protect_Each_Other_Hence